&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "To start, select an attack from the menu below. You likely only have one.",
"offset": Vector2(280, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Your [i]secondary[/i] type is the composition of your outer crust. This thin crust is highly reactive, usually changing multiple times per turn.",
"offset": Vector2(920, -60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_40",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 250.99973),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "Pay attention to the outside of my aura after you attack.",
"offset": Vector2(1560, -60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00134, 250.99973),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_12": {
"dialogue": "As I mentioned, your [i]secondary[/i] type is highly reactive, reacting to any element it comes into contact with.",
"offset": Vector2(600, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_13",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_13": {
"dialogue": "This largely applies to your opponent's attacks. However, your [i]secondary[/i] type will also react to your own [i]melee[/i] attacks, since you're channeling that energy in close quarters.",
"offset": Vector2(920, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_14": {
"dialogue": "Additionally, your [i]secondary[/i] type will react with your [i]primary[/i] type (Only your [i]secondary[/i] will change, of course).",
"offset": Vector2(1240, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_15",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_15": {
"dialogue": "My next attack will be a [el]Red[/el] melee attack, which will demonstrate these effects.",
"offset": Vector2(1560, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00134, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_16": {
"dialogue": "You'll also notice that your transmutations had side effects, which are just stat buffs.",
"offset": Vector2(280, 500),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_17",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00006),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_17": {
"dialogue": "Dallas will teach you a bit more about these in the next lesson.",
"offset": Vector2(600, 480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_18",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 250.99994),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_18": {
"dialogue": "If you're wondering why I haven't had any side effects during this battle, its because I have an item which turns them off. It makes describing the battle mechanics much simpler, don't you think :)",
"offset": Vector2(920, 480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_19",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 250.99994),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_19": {
"dialogue": "Well, that everything I have to teach you. Why don't you finish up this fight and Dallas will pick it up where I left off.",
"offset": Vector2(1240, 480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 250.99994),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_2": {
"dialogue": "Sup. So right, affinities!",
"offset": Vector2(-80, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_20",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_20": {
"dialogue": "So the elements of this world are split into 2 [i]affinity[/i] groups: [color=red]offensive[/color] and [color=blue]defensive[/color].",
"offset": Vector2(240, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_21",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_21": {
"dialogue": "You've noticed the [b]sword[/b] and [b]shield[/b] icons next to your attacks, right? Those tell you which [i]affinity[/i] group that attack's element belongs to.",
"offset": Vector2(560, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_22",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00037, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_22": {
"dialogue": " Its a bit confusing, but these [i]affinity[/i] groups don't actually have anything to do with whether an attack does damage.",
"offset": Vector2(880, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_23",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_23": {
"dialogue": "Like, [el]Blue[/el] is a [color=blue]defensive[/color] type, a lot of its moves will be support or defense focused, but there are [el]Blue[/el] attacks that deal damage.",
"offset": Vector2(1200, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_24",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_24": {
"dialogue": "You can find the full list inside your [i]Transmutation Menu[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(1620, 880),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 251),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_25": {
"dialogue": "Every time you transmute, there will be side effects, which are, like, stat buffs.",
"offset": Vector2(-80, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_26",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 251),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_26": {
"dialogue": "All you have to remember is the end result.",
"offset": Vector2(240, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_27",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_27": {
"dialogue": "If you transmute into an [color=red]offensive[/color] element, you'll get an [color=red]attack[/color] buff.",
"offset": Vector2(560, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_28",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00037, 251),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_28": {
"dialogue": "And if you transmute into a [color=blue]defensive[/color] element, you'll get a [color=blue]defense[/color] boost.",
"offset": Vector2(880, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_29",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_29": {
"dialogue": "This info can also be found inside your [i]Transmutation Menu[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(1200, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_3": {
"dialogue": "Thou hast learned much.",
"offset": Vector2(-60, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_38",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.00012),
"speaker": "Duke",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_30": {
"dialogue": "You went from [el]Purple[/el] to [el]Blue[/el], which are [color=red]offensive[/color] and [color=blue]defensive[/color] types, respectively.",
"offset": Vector2(-80, 1360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_31",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_31": {
"dialogue": "Right, so because your end result was a [color=blue]defensive[/color], so you got a [color=blue]defense[/color] buff.",
"offset": Vector2(240, 1360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_32",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_32": {
"dialogue": "If you hover your mouse over the 3rd and 4th dials under your health bar, they will tell you you've a received a 30% buff to both your defense stats!",
"offset": Vector2(560, 1360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"5_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00037, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_33": {
"dialogue": "And since the attack you used was [el]Magenta[/el], I also received a [color=blue]defense[/color] buff!",
"offset": Vector2(1260, 1360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_34": {
"dialogue": "And since the attack you used didn't react at all with me, I didn't receive any side effects. Bummer dude ;)",
"offset": Vector2(1260, 1620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_35": {
"dialogue": "That was a lot of side effects just then, but I hope you were able to follow all of that.",
"offset": Vector2(-80, 1620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_36",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_36": {
"dialogue": "Every attack can have up to 3 side effects. There's you reacting to the attack's energy, then up to 2 internal changes after that.",
"offset": Vector2(240, 1620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_37",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_37": {
"dialogue": "And if one side transmutes more often than the other, battles can become pretty one sided.",
"offset": Vector2(560, 1620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00037, 251.00037),
"speaker": "Dallas",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_38": {
"dialogue": "Thy final lessons concerns the \"Turn Info\" box in the bottom right of thy screen. ",
"offset": Vector2(260, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_41",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 251.00012),
"speaker": "Duke",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Then, click on me to select your target.",
"offset": Vector2(600, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_40": {
"dialogue": "Each combatant has an aura, which communicates this information to you. The center of this aura shows you their primary type, with your secondary type being shown by the outside.",
"offset": Vector2(1240, -60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_11",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 250.99973),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_41": {
"dialogue": "Pay heed, for this will show you the order in which all shall move, friend and foe alike.",
"offset": Vector2(580, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_42",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00012),
"speaker": "Duke",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_42": {
"dialogue": "It also reveals the elemental quality of our next attacks!",
"offset": Vector2(900, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251.00012),
"speaker": "Duke",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_5": {
"dialogue": "You'll notice a strange popup when you do. This is called the [i]Transmutation Hint[/i].",
"offset": Vector2(920, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_7",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_6": {
"dialogue": "Notice how my [el]Blue[/el] [i]secondary[/i] type reacted with your [el]Magenta[/el] attack to form [el]Purple[/el]?",
"offset": Vector2(280, 200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_12",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 282.00018),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_7": {
"dialogue": "Right now, just remember the color of the top-right square.",
"offset": Vector2(1240, -320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0006, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_8": {
"dialogue": "Unlike most other things in this world, combatants actually have two types.",
"offset": Vector2(280, -60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_9",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 250.99973),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_9": {
"dialogue": "Your [i]primary[/i] type is the composition of your inner core. It has a lot of inertia and will not change during battle.",
"offset": Vector2(600, -60),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_10",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 250.99973),
"speaker": "Aegean",
"sprite": -1
},
